<BaseLayout title="Teachmeet Brighton Digital Festival 2013 #BDF2013" description="Teachmeet Brighton Digital Festival 2013 #BDF2013 - readysaltedcode story">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/stories">Stories</a>
      </nav>
      <h1>Teachmeet Brighton Digital Festival 2013 #BDF2013</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="story-content">
    <div class="container">
      <p>I love the Teachmeet #tmbton at the Brighton Digital Festival. Every year there are fantastic ideas and partnerships that wouldn't happen without this event. I always miss the beginning talks due to childcare so it was great to be able to watch them on the live stream. I am hoping that they will be available after the event too&#8230;. time will tell.</p>
      <p>I was speaking about my new project the Art of Computer Science. A live dance and data visualisation performance based of Computer Science theory. I am really looking forward to the development of this project. Eventually the content and development will be turned into a program that other can then follow to produce their own version of this project. Or as I like to think of it - The next iteration.</p>
      <p>Watch this space for the next instalment.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
